WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the topic and writer schema
Illustrative AIO records use a registered Avro writer schema.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose whether to sample framing
Schema IDs from record framing are inferred links, not proof of downstream use.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Discover, then read coverage first
A bounded snapshot leaves unknown producers and consumers unknown.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Follow the observed relationships
Inspect edge sources and times. Arrows do not all represent event flow.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Read the evidence behind each edge
Observed, declared and inferred links carry different strength.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Treat impact as a lead to verify
Check compatibility and downstream owners separately. Unknown impact is not zero impact.
